# Copy to .env.local (gitignored). Restart npm run dev after changing.
#
# If curriculum / teacher library / login randomly return 403 while EC2 health
# is fine, your network filter may be blocking the EC2 IPs. Use local Docker
# (block below) or another network (e.g. phone hotspot).

